></span><span class="chip2 c-half">09-30</span></div><span class="lab">两市量能 · 亿</span><span class="big">14380.0</span><svg class="spark" viewBox="0 0 180 44" aria-hidden="true"><polyline fill="none" stroke="#e8a33d" stroke-width="2" points="0.0,11.38 45.0,11.38 90.0,6.0 135.0,38.0 180.0,34.86"/></svg><span class="sub2">当日真源读数</span></div><div class="kpi"><div class="top"><span class="ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17l5-6 4 4 6-8 3 4"/></svg></span><span class="chip2 c-half">09-30</span></div><span class="lab">周期投票主判</span><span class="big">退潮</span><span class="sub2">当日真源读数</span></div><div class="kpi"><div class="top"><span class="ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 20V10m5 10V4m5 16v-7"/></svg></span><span class="chip2 c-half">09-30</span></div><span class="lab">市场温度 · 250日分位</span><span class="big">39.3</span><div class="gauge"><div class="gtrack"><i class="gmark" style="left:39.3%"></i></div><div class="gl"><span>冷</span><span>中性</span><span>热</span></div></div><span class="sub2">当日真源读数</span></div><div class="kpi"><div class="top"><span class="ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14l6-6 4 4 6-6"/></svg></span><span class="chip2 c-half">09-30</span></div><span class="lab">执行仓位上限</span><span class="big">—</span><span class="sub2">当日该口径数据缺失，未填补</span></div></div><div class="card"><b>数据边界</b><ul><li>兼容导入旧判断；原文立场未重新验证。</li><li>旧 HTML 补充按原栏目职责归位；相似判断仅提示重叠，不作语义删除。</li></ul></div><section id="volume"><h2>一 量能台阶 · 我站在哪一阶</h2><div id="component-VOLSTEP"><!--VOLSTEP-->
<div class="card"><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">量能台阶 <span class="hint">机器核对 · 米开换算表(手册V2 §2.3) · 温度表权威</span></h3><div class="steps"><div class="step dim"><span class="sr">≥3.8</span><span class="sn">主升2确认<small>放量突破</small></span><span class="sd"></span></div>
