<div class="step dim"><span class="sr">3.3~3.5</span><span class="sn">强修<small>量能承接</small></span><span class="sd"></span></div>
<div class="step dim"><span class="sr">3.0~3.3</span><span class="sn">过渡<small>量能中枢</small></span><span class="sd"></span></div>
<div class="step cur"><span class="sr">&lt;3.0</span><span class="sn">弱修<small>缩量分歧</small></span><span class="sd"><span class="dayc">09-28 1.7</span><span class="dayc">09-29 1.41</span><span class="dayc now">09-30 1.44</span></span></div>
</div><div class="hint">量能 1.44 万亿落&quot;弱修&quot;档 —— 米开量能台阶换算(手册V2 §2.3 A档, 腾讯替代源); 当日涨停52/温度39.3(偏冷), 档位与温度档偏冷联动判读。</div></div>

<!--/VOLSTEP--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-99bbe4616adc8d23"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-7ab04b161ac4c1fd"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>量能退潮线下，五路同判防守，生态修复不升档</h3></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-93ee501f194a9631"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能台阶→先行指标三窗→五路周期投票→连板梯队→攻防总开关。周期路只做环境判定，不荐个股、不写交易计划。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-b899e8f89906f784"></span><span id="claim-cycle-7ef1518d7c7ee2b9"></span><span id="claim-cycle-a5cb0050e7d1c946"></span><span id="claim-cycle-5d72e1a5d2829ad9"></span><span id="claim-cycle-7d435b9591c62d9b"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-dab34c465a91c693"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>↘退潮线下两市量能14380.0亿1.438万亿；结构台阶在1.3—1.5万亿抱团+套利区间，但低于3万亿退潮线</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-753ff8cd700f44f3"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>◷主判·降情绪阶段退潮温度39.3偏冷；涨停52、炸板12、跌停9、炸板率18.8%、封板率81.25%</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e282c15622739d7b"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>♨偏冷市场温度39.3冰点偏冷中性偏热过热未触发温度&lt;25冰点进攻窗，也未触发温度≥85过热禁追窗</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-fc4e5a2878ed9378"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>⌁空仓/0—2成执行状态防守观察置信度80/100（未校准评分）；生态修复不自动转成进攻指令</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-b166aba8127ab4ab"></span><span id="claim-cycle-691a4de410ee7177"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-057fd9ce69c68a52"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>两市成交额 <strong>14380.0亿</strong>（即 <strong>1.438万亿</strong>）。按规则表的结构台阶，处于1.3—1.5万亿“抱团+套利”区间；按周期门槛，低于看多需3.3万亿、主升需3.5万亿，也低于3万亿退潮线。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-e04929af8df1910a"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-3c84e1f0c4e4bece"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能说明盘面仍有交易，但不能把局部封板修复上修为启动或主升。结构台阶与情绪三态分开处理：当前总开关按退潮防守，方向取降。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-833955bd082c431e"></span></div></section><section id="leading"><h2>二 先行指标 · 三窗触发器</h2><div id="component-LEADIND"><!--LEADIND--><div class="card"><p style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">情绪先行指标 · 近20日 <span class="mut" style="font-weight:400">(脚本段A档 · 情绪先行指标.py --card · 当日温度 —,阈值冰点&lt;25/过热≥85)</span></p><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683">涨停数_净=52</div><svg viewBox="0 0 880 196" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block"><line x1="46" y1="172" x2="866" y2="172" stroke="#3a3f46"></line><line x1="46" y1="143.0" x2="866" y2="143.0" stroke="#8a6d2f" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="0.8"></line><text x="866" y="140.0" font-size="8.5" fill="#8a6d2f" text-anchor="end">1进2率10%=接力冰点参考线</text><rect x="55.8" y="58.4" width="21.3" height="113.6" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="66.5" y="55" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">77</text><rect x="96.8" y="51.0" width="21.3" height="121.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="107.5" y="48" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">82</text><rect x="137.8" y="42.1" width="21.3" height="129.9" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="148.5" y="39" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">88</text><rect x="178.8" y="49.5" width="21.3" height="122.5" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="189.5" y="47" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">83</text><rect x="219.8" y="95.3" width="21.3" height="76.7" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="230.5" y="92" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="mi