<p style="margin:6px 0 0" class="mut">温度表涨停52只 · 炸板率18.8%</p></div>

<!--/LADDER--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-fde974d8a4e8c587"></span><span id="claim-cycle-359a01e59be3d930"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-83c424197bde641a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>涨停池共<strong>52</strong>只：<strong>7板1、5板0、4板1、3板4、2板6、1板40</strong>。5板断层，7板孤高，首板数量占多数，中位承接仍薄。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-6de42d07d6c7353b"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e643e3e1d5f0560c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>高度存在但没有形成连续梯队；2板6只、3板4只、4板1只，向上承接断在5板。行业聚集和孤高高标只能形成观察锚，不能覆盖偏冷温度、量能退潮线与接力门槛。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-221584a88714f66b"></span></div></section><section id="position"><h2>五 攻防 · 仓位总开关</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-cf084d450dc7d19c"></span><span id="claim-cycle-849281211aa29f22"></span><span id="claim-cycle-295a2ce457006394"></span><span id="claim-cycle-314ab75938b2c0ef"></span><span id="claim-cycle-05b0ba91fbe5db1b"></span><span id="claim-cycle-0819fc499c2e6fac"></span><span id="claim-cycle-83791d1939e3662a"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-f51b571c53e3b9db"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><b>禁项：</b>不因封板率接近80%就追高；不接力孤立最高板；不把行业归类、B档题材、观察票或桥接结果写成主线；不把null溢价、预测质量或未发生T+1写成正向事实。周期路到此为止，不荐个股、不写交易计划。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-3f1a5b352121fdf9"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p><b>明日可证伪条件：</b>若同时出现温度≥45、跌停≤5、封板率≥85%、炸板率&lt;15%，且clean一进二率&gt;25%、出现可核验3板承接并修复中位断层，随后质量池T+1实测执1均收≥0，才复议退潮主判；缺任一关键项，维持防守，不以单项修复改判。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-73fe0f860a1f88e5"></span></div></section><section id="research"><h2>六 自主深挖 · 指标与阈值孵化</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-e28838406fd3a5fa"></span><span id="claim-cycle-b4cdf7c87364eb85"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-57a0866de6d9eb13"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>昨日涨停溢价为null且触发器为空；质量池T+1未结算；全市场9:25竞价快照、竞价额排名和逐笔撤单量缺失；题材归位52/52为B档行业兜底，THS涨停原因与A档产业催化缺失。这些缺口影响拐点识别，不用未来结果或其他日期结果填补。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-e3c29e9cc207d09b"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-8071be7320b92e17"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>把“温度≥45 + 跌停≤5 + 封板率≥85% + 炸板率&lt;15% + clean一进二率&gt;25% + 3板承接/中位断层修复 + T+1实测执1均收≥0”作为联合观察闸门；这是可证伪假设，不是今日已发生事实。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-15cb56bdf6eadafb"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>深挖结论：今日是量能退潮、局部生态修复与交易层防守并存。研究优先级不是追踪单一最高板，而是补齐溢价、竞价、质量实测、A档催化和中位梯队证据，再检验量能是否真正传导到接力。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-b377bd0c5fc47af8"></span></div></section><section id="cognition"><h2>七 我的认知迭代 · 最新</h2><div class="tl"><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-a4a1ea155b00efee"></span></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-f35e50faa8f17b86"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-0c27a99880943575"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="tli"><b>09-30</b> 量能退潮线优先于局部生态修复：成交额14380.0亿低于3万亿退潮线，封板率81.25%只能进入观察层，不能单独打开进攻总开关。</div></div><details class="chain tlfold"><summary><b>其余认知与原文证据</b><span class="chip">2条</span></summary><div class="inner"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-c540b264c4da552e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="tli"><b>09-30</b> 五路同向仍要保留桥接属性：五票均为各路当日C档判断的机械桥接，且共享部分环境底座；同向结果支持保守裁决，不等于五个独立样本。</div></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-86466e0ca32e1ca7"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-cognition">认知</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><div class="tli"><b>09-30</b> 高度必须与中位宽度同步：7板孤高、5板断层、1板40只；只有3板承接、中位梯队、A档催化与T+1实测共同改善，才允许复议退潮。</div></div></div></details></div></section><details class="chain"><summary>编辑说明与来源审计</summary><div class="inner"><div class="claim-anchor-bank" aria-hidden="true"><pre class="claim-anchor-text">Cycle · 周期与情绪 · 截至 2026-09-30 收盘
